.TH PORTFOLIO-JOCKEY 1 "2026-11-03" "Portfolio Jockey 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
portfolio-jockey \- local encrypted project tracker
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B portfolio-jockey
.SH DESCRIPTION
Portfolio Jockey opens the local project tracker. Project files are stored in
an encrypted vault on this device.
.SH OPTIONS
The graphical application does not currently accept command-line options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flatpak (1)